{"id":"bbac61b28f38b09f","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-russell-paradox.md","title":"Russell Paradox","display":"df-russell-paradox — Russell Paradox","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-russell-paradox","aliases":["90-df-russell-paradox"],"display":"df-russell-paradox — Russell Paradox","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-russell-paradox"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-russell-paradox</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-russell-paradox — Russell Paradox"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (candidate set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Russell}\">\\(\\mathrm{Russell}\\)</span> (Russell-comprehension predicate, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}russell\\text{-}paradox}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\;(x\\in R\\leftrightarrow x\\notin x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&amp;\\rightarrow(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R),\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\exists R\\;\\mathrm{Russell}(R).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}russell\\text{-}paradox}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\;(x\\in R\\leftrightarrow x\\notin x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&amp;\\rightarrow(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R),\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\exists R\\;\\mathrm{Russell}(R).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>矛盾否定的是无类型的无限制概括原则。ZFC 的分离公理只允许从既有集合中分离子集，不能形成“所有不属于自身的集合”的集合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Russell}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}russell\\text{-}paradox}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\;(x\\in R\\leftrightarrow x\\notin x),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n&\\rightarrow(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R),\\\\\n&\\neg\\exists R\\;\\mathrm{Russell}(R).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.","display":true}],"bytes":875,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f6e727d451fa23c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b767163b85aaf61c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-fact